OL,3,GNEWSAMy 12-year-old prefers kettlebells
OL,4,Ato social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the age of social media and body
OL,7,Fimage obsession, 12-year-old Robyn is
OL,8,Fmore interested in what her body can do
OL,9,Fthan how it looks, her mum says.
OL,11,FRobyn has "flown" since she lifted her
OL,12,Ffirst kettlebell in January, inspired
OL,13,Fby her mum Louise who also takes part
OL,14,Fin the sport.
OL,16,FBut kettlebell training is much more
OL,17,Fthan a sport to her.
OL,19,F"You can get really strong, everybody
OL,20,Fis really nice and supportive and it's
OL,21,Fnot too complicated," said Robyn, who
OL,22,Flives in Nottingham.
